    <DataNode elementId="MONOMER-840" textLabel="gibberellin 2-oxidase" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q8S0S6" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="955.61328125" centerY="1188.43896484375" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The &lt;i&gt;Oryza sativa GA2ox3&lt;/i&gt; gene was expressed in &lt;i&gt;E.coli&lt;/i&gt; and shown to encode for a gibberellin (GA) 2-oxidase. Cell lysates of &lt;i&gt;E.coli&lt;/i&gt; expressing &lt;i&gt;GA2ox3&lt;/i&gt; could catalyze the 2-oxidation of a variety of GAs, including GA&lt;sub&gt;20&lt;/sub&gt; and GA&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt; to GA&lt;sub&gt;29&lt;/sub&gt; and GA&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;, respectively |CITS:[12736788]|; GA&lt;sub&gt;29&lt;/sub&gt; was further metabolized to GA&lt;sub&gt;29&lt;/sub&gt;-catabolite (whereas GA&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;-catabolite was not observed). Moreover, transgenic rice plants ectopically expressing &lt;i&gt;GA2ox3&lt;/i&gt; were shown to have elevated levels of GA&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt; and GA&lt;sub&gt;29&lt;/sub&gt; (corresponding to an inactivation of GA&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt; and GA&lt;sub&gt;20&lt;/sub&gt;) |CITS:[11244129]|. The expression of this gene is regulated by biologically active GA in a feed-forward manner |CITS:[11244129]|. Study of the amino acid structure of the protein suggests that it contains a Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;-binding site.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="MONOMER-840" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Phytozome" value="Os01t0757200-01" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Interpro" value="IPR026992" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pfam" value="PF14226" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Prosite" value="PS51471" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Modbase" value="Q8S0S6" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Swissmodel" value="Q8S0S6" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q8S0S6" />
